        "ids": [
          "ojo.tummyComfy.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Oops, too full! Let's try again and leave a little space.",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.tummyFull.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Ayu is still a little hungry. One more bite?",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.tummyHungry.1"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "code": "A4",
    "voice": "Ojo",
    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "Now let's try it for real, with a grown-up!",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.taskInvite.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Can you do this today, my friend?",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.taskInvite.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When you've done it, a grown-up can tick it for you.",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.taskPending.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "I can't wait to hear how it went!",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.taskPending.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Well done, my friend! You did it for real.",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.taskDone.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Well done! You did it today.",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.taskDoneToday.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "You earned a new sticker!",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.newSticker.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "You found a drop of light in the story!",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.bookDrop.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A treasure chest! You played on three days this week.",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.chest.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Look at your garden! Flowers never wilt here.",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.garden.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Play today and your first flower will bloom!",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.gardenEmpty.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Keep playing to collect more drops!",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.needDrops.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Great playing, my friend! Now let's try it for real.",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.sessionEnd.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Let's go and do it for real now. Bye for now, my friend!",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.sessionEnd.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "My treasure is full! Eight drops of light. Thank you, my friend!",
        "ids": [
          "ojo.allDone.1"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "code": "B1",
    "voice": "Narrator",
    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "Put your hand on your heart and feel Ojo go thum, thum. Then give someone you love a big hug.",
        "ids": [
          "task.1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Wake up with the birds tomorrow and say good morning to the sun.",
        "ids": [
          "task.2"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Brush your teeth in the morning and at night, with a grown-up watching.",
        "ids": [
          "task.3"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Close your eyes and tell a grown-up three sounds you can hear.",
        "ids": [
          "task.4"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Chew your rice slowly, slowly, until it starts to taste sweet.",
        "ids": [
          "task.5"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "If something breaks or goes wrong today, tell a grown-up the truth.",
        "ids": [
          "task.6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Lights out at the same time tonight, right after your bedtime story.",
        "ids": [
          "task.7"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Stop eating when your tummy feels comfy, and say \"Thank you, tummy!\"",
        "ids": [
          "task.8"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
